   "lines": [
    "In the morning we",
    "sailed round to the",
    "Chapins house where we",
    "took dinner; in the",
    "afternoon started back,",
    "against a strong",
    "S. W. wind; at sunset",
    "we put into Saybrook",
    "harbour. Saw a shark",
    "(5[?] or [illegible]) and a good",
    "many porpoises - all",
    "serving as targets",
    "for our revolvers."
   ],
